@ref Rules, Điều 15 (src:775-818)
GIVEN `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
      `what it carries` IS A `What the vehicle carries`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An exclusion point`
`art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `the loss` `what it carries` MEANS
    `the points that fire among`
        (LIST (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 15.1 wear, defect or repair`,         `fires` IS `the facts`'s `wear and tear, inherent vice, loss of commercial value, defect, or damage from repair`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 15.2 engine damage in flood water`,   `fires` IS `the facts`'s `water hammer in the combustion engine from operating in flood water` OR `the facts`'s `electric motor of an electric car damaged by operating in flood water`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 15.3 tyres, tarpaulins or badges alone`, `fires` IS `the facts`'s `only tyres, tarpaulins or badges damaged, nothing else by the same cause in the accident`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 15.4 theft of parts`,                 `fires` IS `the loss`'s `cause of the damage` EQUALS `theft or robbery of parts of the vehicle`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 15.5 fraud or abuse of trust`,        `fires` IS `the facts`'s `whole vehicle lost by fraud or abuse of trust`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 15.6 electrical damage`,              `fires` IS `the facts`'s `electrical damage by overload, overpressure, short circuit, self-heating, arcing or leakage`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 15.7 overload of 50% or more`,        `fires` IS `the overload, as a share of the permitted figure` (`the loss`'s `circumstances`'s `load`) `what it carries` AT LEAST 50%)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 15.8 added equipment`,                `fires` IS `the facts`'s `loss of equipment fitted beyond the manufacturer's, not protective and not permitted` OR `the facts`'s `loss caused by such added equipment`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 15.9 own special equipment`,          `fires` IS `the facts`'s `loss caused by the operation of the vehicle's own special equipment`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 15.10 damage by the goods carried`,   `fires` IS `the facts`'s `damage by the goods carried, not from a collision or overturning`))
    WHERE
        `the facts` MEANS `the loss`'s `exclusion facts`

-- Điều 11 for this chapter, then Điều 15: physical damage is damage to property, so Điều 11.4
-- applies to it.
@ref Rules, Điều 15, chapeau (src:776-777), with Điều 11 (src:611-666)
GIVEN `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
      `what it carries` IS A `What the vehicle carries`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An exclusion point`
`art 11 and 15 — the exclusions that apply to the physical damage claim` `the loss` `what it carries` MEANS
    append (`art 11 — the general exclusions that apply` (`the loss`'s `circumstances`) `what it carries` TRUE)
           (`art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `the loss` `what it carries`)

§§ `Điều 16 — the sum insured and the market value`

-- src:820 | Điều 16 Số tiền bảo hiểm và giá trị bảo hiểm (giá thị trường)
-- 16.1 The sum insured is what the owner asks to insure the vehicle for, stated on the
-- certificate, and no greater than its market value when the contract is concluded.
-- 16.2 The owner may insure at or below the market value.
-- src:822 | 1. Số tiền bảo hiểm là số tiền mà Chủ xe yêu cầu Bảo hiểm Tasco bảo hiểm cho xe của mình và
