GIVEN `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`art 18.1.2(a) — the ratio for under-insurance` `the cover` MEANS
    IF   `the cover`'s `sum insured` LESS THAN `the cover`'s `market value when the contract was concluded`
    THEN `the cover`'s `sum insured` DIVIDED BY `the cover`'s `market value when the contract was concluded`
    ELSE 1

